          <section class="policy-content">
            <p>Golden Apple Productions (“we”, “us”, “our”) respects your privacy and is committed to protecting your
              personal data. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, share, and protect your personal
              information when you visit or interact with www.gapstudio.in</p>

            <h2>1. Personal Data We Collect</h2>
            <p>We may collect information that you voluntarily provide when you:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Fill out contact or booking forms</li>
              <li>Request services or demos</li>
              <li>Communicate with us via email or messaging platforms</li>
            </ul>
            <p>This may include:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Name</li>
              <li>Address</li>
              <li>Email address</li>
              <li>Phone number</li>
              <li>Company or brand details</li>
              <li>Service preferences</li>
              <li>Budget</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>2. How We Use Your Data</h2>
            <p>We use your personal information to:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Provide, manage, and deliver our services</li>
              <li>Send confirmations and service-related notifications</li>
              <li>Respond to queries and support requests via phone/whatsapp/email/visit</li>
              <li>Share promotional information</li>
              <li>Improve our website, offerings, and customer experience</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>3. Cookies & Tracking Technologies</h2>
            <p>We may use cookies and similar technologies to:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Improve user experience and navigation</li>
              <li>Analyze website usage and performance</li>
              <li>Understand how visitors interact with content</li>
            </ul>
            <p>You can manage cookie preferences through your browser settings.</p>

            <h2>4. How We Share Your Information</h2>
            <p>We may share your personal data with:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Service providers (e.g., payment processors, hosting partners)</li>
              <li>Legal authorities if required by law</li>
              <li>Third parties as required</li>
            </ul>
            <p>🚫 We do not sell your personal data.</p>

            <h2>5. Data Security</h2>
            <p>We implement reasonable security measures to protect your personal data. However, no method of online
              transmission is 100% secure.</p>

            <h2>6. Third-Party Services</h2>
            <p>Our website may include links to third-party websites or tools. Their privacy practices are governed by
              their respective privacy policies.</p>

            <h2>7. Changes to This Policy</h2>
            <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted here with a revised
              effective date.</p>

            <h2>8. Contact Information</h2>
